    {
      "id": "30e787c4bb17fdf3e90fdad9c3c352719b220c3a951316cca51d8e918e0f12cd",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c1f912ce05304c90621490386b52ede03bd51454ce05cfb8c659c496678a15e",
      "text": "Sessions, Context Windows & Turns",
      "hash": "6ba86329848f193a00922dde232ac1e483d8805be061a48f5580560ee54d0b69"
    },
    {
      "id": "b309375cf5637d33f122395e729cc754d76e7537869e7b095abe9865ff8513cf",
      "text": "Context",
      "hash": "a6e600a10fede40f648be37a700467776215ed2da3c271e9d02fa2987190a0a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "257e7f053137e9a42914ab2043fd9dbc479de7df584f5953baba6132f342e42f",
      "text": "The relevant information the agent has access to right now — what the agent knows that's pertinent to the task.",
      "hash": "390e062000485f74e2afa938a5ec85ad4d0f73c064c9111c7d0b7ab5e5e84362"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b982d439bab7416b2b71d20be3470c998f3eaacf4ccba811fb22d0c7bb870f9",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "07a957d689760604c12e4979b714f467cce4aa745b654a405adcd25e98847552",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "3cb54b6a5bb05b3152fe8ddf72c6de5d988e6f0d38aeba04ab80c9c7fe77b438",
      "text": "The relevant information the",
      "hash": "c98c8aad2e3a69acc6de2c425c7c71c082007e57efa8fceda3ef581a7dda9b9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba94ac4766a5c2714b1f491317f93ca9a66803ffd6dead827dec85289f02d62b",
      "text": "has access to right now. The abstract noun — not the raw input the model sees (that's the",
      "hash": "d91d7d54b22a36d63edd1280ba46bf3248c0b514dae84e3ca64366c6af78a0de"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb9c676623eb6f0e76b9f256ead7a572dacf3d589f597a891fbf71fa398128b8",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "25c1a9981014cd2987e22b2aece3519e6dc38e41888bded842e9d13ebeb7877e",
      "text": "), not the running history (that's the",
      "hash": "fedaa2580d5eb765aef73005f972d978ecdf346d47c7835e5ce60e139fbdf218"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b4aad1d66a79e15f64b9c8abc7330d374e2743b332cd73aeabcae5dea00b67",
      "text": "), but",
      "hash": "a92a67daa29761fc3018a2235b19091264a8c635f5f1610dbb1418c37de13713"
    },
    {
      "id": "295baee87dcadf3152804595092124db75e9d151a8af73810dc0abfaab615d40",
      "text": "what the agent knows that's pertinent to the task",
      "hash": "3e23a224d28da99d2f169b5e1cd1537dff8d41b62555c469e251c04f3f0f5e74"
    },
    {
      "id": "089c4f177e32588d31da689f46caf5b3dbbffdbd598c0e281b1acbb0d8ac9b42",
      "text": ". \"Loading something into context\" means making it part of this set; \"context engineering\" is the discipline of curating it.",
      "hash": "d96b2675868348ba68d48ec98cf23e17c800f3ae44f0f26bdb2d38fc18c2e2fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d49da3d8ac378df19a2fbd4f6e89a33670d83d93552b80d85e500615bb5c60f",
      "text": "The three terms separate cleanly:",
      "hash": "1eee6732a113dbccedf3ae48f55f9c4cae2b22ff377dec1f134e25770c7fe5c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "55147a7d98aa0f269989d2b669eabc462327b0f0b912dcf3653d1c57a00ab57f",
      "text": "Term",
      "hash": "c6f3bfd45614178abb5730fa5acd9aa446f914c4ebfea3574dd281b19d437f07"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8a6b14d72600553763f3fda944ec5cfbff4fa16e073c7259fad66cd513e183d",
      "text": "What it names",
      "hash": "2db6779d7caf91456baf39a967856fc2bebc84cd6ef502b9f495142fc7d1e93d"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c4dba0600925252350002ea75b2b151b481f9009c7a6884e9617d5d883fa04a",
      "text": "The task-relevant information the agent currently has",
      "hash": "6e067bd13779d0ebbf9d217c353d0883a91af8d291056bf228ac4e7bfa24d4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1cb98e9daf76da76983816fe85e747743459fb72ed26807efcd6e00e2b0595d",
      "text": "Context window",
      "hash": "7696d0855331622dc12438057f5509348f9d6f0ec2eb3580e18a99d31eba86db"
    },
    {
      "id": "9df437c02638d397b505d49ea9cc799628f905db0c92698ee79db1b1d869856e",
      "text": "The literal",
      "hash": "b5314f22d269fc659fa90fc40407159207adba994e2cb8950df533f6a138233b"
    },
    {
      "id": "2230675ee0b119af3cd7763f86a21f8de73131c35007ed4385c84cdc59c0e220",
      "text": "sequence the model sees per request",
      "hash": "e6cca4227aa55bf44a165e8625ee59a312659f7cd5c929fcbef7dc6ff5a8a877"
    },
    {
      "id": "362e88ebc69f3f0e55c4a13312a00e802cfa9cfd936541eb2879ab360ea4c60a",
      "text": "Session",
      "hash": "6959b4159575d8dd76d9f3bbe2c6437904f861e7860c35abd18deffb1c3425a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d16f8c6a21ab649d0dc35a66081b71ed3cdd6127268ee30e7d90079e661e57f",
      "text": "The running conversation the",
      "hash": "3597d6c83624aefc6fa8516862cfb80fc45757ec235d47c1c990665567030cb3"
    },
    {
      "id": "66617ae37f9347d40e99a4465ed1cada866c65adf290f044b4b2873a8009f75f",
      "text": "View Table",
      "hash": "aa0a0f6baf57a603925533ee10fab7f6bb4e7002e7d8df106b2bc671e1d72567"
    },
    {
      "id": "94aeb391ecfcb48265503907ceb75ab19adbffcaeed0fbb4d0a48ef3f855b273",
      "text": "The separation matters because context is a measure of quality, not quantity. A context window can be nearly full and the context still poor — thousands of tokens of stale tool output, none of it about the task at hand. It can also be nearly empty and the context excellent: the one type definition the task turns on.",
      "hash": "1a21a7e7d01c6a6bd5e82a54cf5709a6f808a6546adbca2527da81700d670561"
    },
    {
      "id": "d122f14fb5d7944a50ff57bcfce7b2478ce4a23a5e6f8a9a06006cdf8405aa92",
      "text": "Most day-to-day failures trace back to context. When the agent invents an API, contradicts a decision, or guesses at a schema, the first question is what was in context when it did — usually the relevant fact was never loaded, or was buried under",
      "hash": "0e437c1ab3c4d30a7d5c355358028f09a87bf11bd9b9ba300d6c1b3ab2e230d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6264359a9b7db1b18cf5d484b04961cd46e58b8b54ff55c7864999f1ff3047",
      "text": "attention degradation",
      "hash": "79e5ddec1498a24115fe8cb565695632f5d9c71beafb43cd0a04d319ef44230f"
    },
    {
      "id": "dbdef2c24e24dafbf3903422f5563a694e9adf31e4e686d99c7b747cab3c86cf",
      "text": ". The fix is curation: load what the task needs, keep out what it doesn't.",
      "hash": "ce46b2b7ef00da3c0b0a2c32f3d836ae51eed87fa045f07f01afd578fac753ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "7fab598c192a72194285816bc190d39d8596353febb7814492bd994af74cfece",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "9439023a32b7130e4f87e41e091e46c4f4b9f67c240cdf75aada3a331e08e060",
      "text": "\"It keeps inventing fields that aren't in the type.\"",
      "hash": "d1c8d9dcc50c81baba6c57acc479ff2f230ac24b9b07261e5ffd1eec8c5ae072"
    },
    {
      "id": "91423d428834bb6c603529c16f45b55b82499006a0bb14252ad15f255c1e781a",
      "text": "\"The type file isn't in context — it's reading the call sites and guessing. Read the definition in first.\"",
      "hash": "e73ffe24c573a480a1d9f2cd6eb2934810b69c0a6e412458da85dd9a5aa8d2e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "66edb36591eae1d9bdd33aac0994a1cd8e547c6b7aa494239feaf7f42f694bff",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ecca938addee105263b07a24a1d9b5022c9fa6818aebcd951cbcb4f3786c05c",
      "text": "Stateless",
      "hash": "f0916a93b0a1776f11d26f8ea012555868465f41131bb6037f712455ac330788"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7619aa9de4b52632bf2b8d4541240fe79bdcb94591d9c7510a46bcffa8513c4",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb36b4a726a93bbc933de0e798c1e93024d36ac63554a0289ea3d89a3e884b7c",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e1b1662064802139e26c052d4f1195443515e908c5d6c01a4bf262c5c6e2359",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "150743cf304b3e85ec8be7f44ac65c767ba198784333e27bf9d4751073297c40",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "35066afd221e566eb1bda10b1140f40e5e398b23430bfa297075c96bbaeb7f45",
